        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.13803100585938,
        200.16139221191406,
        99.72802734375
      ],
      "text": "Gastric aspiration",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        109.081298828125,
        155.04739379882812,
        125.8093032836914
      ],
      "text": "Background",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        132.75180053710938,
        513.3916015625,
        146.17230224609375
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis. Children with TB may swallow mucus that contains M.  Gastric aspiration",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        148.81732177734375,
        513.3914794921875,
        162.1688232421875
      ],
      "text": "is a technique used to collect gastric contents to try to confirm the diagnosis of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        164.8138427734375,
        513.4605102539062,
        178.16534423828125
      ],
      "text": "by microscopy and mycobacterial culture. Because of the distress caused to the child,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        180.81036376953125,
        513.4834594726562,
        194.161865234375
      ],
      "text": "and the generally low yield of smear-positivity on microscopy, this procedure should be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        196.806884765625,
        513.4833984375,
        210.15838623046875
      ],
      "text": "used only where culture is available as well as microscopy. Microscopy can sometimes",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        212.80340576171875,
        513.4144897460938,
        226.1549072265625
      ],
      "text": "give false-positive results (especially in HIV-positive children who are at risk of having",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        228.7999267578125,
        513.4605712890625,
        242.15142822265625
      ],
      "text": "non-tuberculous mycobacteria). Culture allows susceptibility of the organism to anti-TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        244.79644775390625,
        207.1003875732422,
        258.14794921875
      ],
      "text": "drugs to be determined.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        269.30291748046875,
        513.4603881835938,
        282.6544189453125
      ],
      "text": "Gastric aspirates are used for collection of samples for microscopy and mycobacterial",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        285.2994384765625,
        513.3799438476562,
        298.65093994140625
      ],
      "text": "cultures in young children when sputa cannot be either spontaneously expectorated",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        301.29595947265625,
        513.4719848632812,
        314.6474609375
      ],
      "text": "or induced using hypertonic saline. It is most useful for young hospitalized children.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        317.29248046875,
        513.4258422851562,
        330.64398193359375
      ],
      "text": "However, the diagnostic yield (positive culture) of a set of three gastric aspirates is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        333.2889709472656,
        513.4720458984375,
        346.6404724121094
      ],
      "text": "only about 25–50% of children with TB disease, so a negative smear or culture never",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        349.28546142578125,
        513.471923828125,
        362.636962890625
      ],
      "text": "excludes TB in a child. Gastric aspirates are collected from young children suspected of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        365.2819519042969,
        513.4028930664062,
        378.6334533691406
      ],
      "text": "having pulmonary TB. During sleep, the mucociliary system of the lung beats mucus up",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        381.2784423828125,
        513.403076171875,
        394.62994384765625
      ],
      "text": "into the throat. The mucus is swallowed and remains in the stomach until the stomach",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        397.2749328613281,
        509.5505065917969,
        410.6264343261719
      ],
      "text": "empties. The highest-yield specimens are therefore obtained first thing in the morning.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        421.8287048339844,
        513.4835815429688,
        435.1802062988281
      ],
      "text": "Gastric aspiration on each of two consecutive mornings should be performed for each",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        437.8251953125,
        513.4603271484375,
        451.17669677734375
      ],
      "text": "patient. This is the number that seems to maximize the yield of smear-positivity. Note",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        453.8216857910156,
        513.4605712890625,
        467.1731872558594
      ],
      "text": "that the first gastric aspirate has the highest yield. Performing the test properly usually",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        469.81817626953125,
        513.4259643554688,
        483.169677734375
      ],
      "text": "requires two people (one doing the test and an assistant). The child should have been",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        485.8146667480469,
        513.3914184570312,
        499.1661682128906
      ],
      "text": "fasting for at least 4 hours (3 hours for infant) before the procedure. Children with a low",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        501.8111572265625,
        386.9144287109375,
        515.1626586914062
      ],
      "text": "platelet count or bleeding should not undergo the procedure.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        526.3176879882812,
        261.4263610839844,
        539.669189453125
      ],
      "text": "The following equipment is needed:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        548.7811279296875,
        152.743408203125,
        562.713134765625
      ],
      "text": "gloves -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        569.18115234375,
        349.8913879394531,
        583.1131591796875
      ],
      "text": "nasogastric tube (usually 10 French or larger) -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        589.5809936523438,
        513.4994506835938,
        603.5130004882812
      ],
      "text": "syringe of capacity 5, 10, 20 or 30 ml, with appropriate connector for the  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.7394027709961,
        603.9810180664062,
        204.75140380859375,
        617.9130249023438
      ],
      "text": "nasogastric tube",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        624.3809814453125,
        184.0753936767578,
        638.31298828125
      ],
      "text": "litmus paper -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        644.7811279296875,
        220.07540893554688,
        658.713134765625
      ],
      "text": "specimen container -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        665.1810302734375,
        244.09939575195312,
        679.113037109375
      ],
      "text": "pen (to label specimens) -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        685.5809936523438,
        261.8594055175781,
        699.5130004882812
      ],
      "text": "laboratory requisition forms -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        705.9810791015625,
        335.4313659667969,
        719.9130859375
      ],
      "text": "sterile water or normal saline (0.9% NaCl) -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        726.3809814453125,
        298.1233825683594,
        740.31298828125
      ],
      "text": "sodium bicarbonate solution (8%)  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        746.7811279296875,
        232.08738708496094,
        760.713134765625
      ],
      "text": "alcohol/chlorhexidine. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        8.642800331115723,
        805.8439331054688,
        42.002803802490234,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "120",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
